# Lesson 3 (Mind your pitch) with the gas held and no tilt lands nose-first: the run is over with the
# crash explained; Try again restarts the lesson.
until 300 Hillwheel
frames 150
click Learn. Five short lessons
until 60 Mind your pitch
frames 10
click =Mind your pitch
until 120 TILT
hold KeyW
until 1200 Run over
release KeyW
frames 20
expect You landed nose-first or too hard
save lesson-3-crashed
click =Try again
until 120 m to the flag
frames 60
save lesson-3-again
